---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Linux Mod Lab"
  description="Learn about Linux Mod Lab, an open-source initiative advancing Linux game modding, compatibility research, and community development."
>
  <section class="section about-section about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label">ABOUT LINUX MOD LAB</span>

      <h1>Breaking compatibility barriers.</h1>

      <p>
        Linux Mod Lab is an independent, open-source initiative
        dedicated to expanding what's possible with game modding
        on Linux.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>

      <p>
        We investigate compatibility challenges, develop
        open-source solutions, and share reproducible research
        that helps Linux gamers and developers work together.
      </p>

      <h2>Where We're Starting</h2>

      <p>
        Our initial research focuses on GTA V Legacy, RAGE Plugin
        Hook, LSPDFR, Wine, and Proton.
      </p>

      <p>
        Gentoo Linux serves as our primary research environment,
        but our goal is to develop solutions that benefit users
        across Linux distributions.
      </p>

      <h2>Looking Ahead</h2>

      <p>
        Linux Mod Lab aims to grow into a collaborative community
        supporting compatibility research, original open-source
        modifications, documentation, and development tools.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <style>
  .about-page h1 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }

  .about-page h2 {
    margin-top: 55px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .about-page p {
    max-width: 760px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
</BaseLayout>